Quest Kobolds Stolen Goods
    Events
    Conditions
    Actions
        Set VariableSet KoboldChestDying = (Dying destructible)
        Set VariableSet KoboldChests = (KoboldChests - 1)
        -------- Chance to drop Stolen Goods --------
        Set VariableSet Chance_StolenGoods = (Random integer number between 1 and 2)
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                Chance_StolenGoods Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                Item - Create Stolen Goods at (Position of (Dying destructible))
                Set VariableSet Chance_StolenGoods = 0
                Wait 5.00 seconds
                Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
                Destructible - Remove KoboldChestDying
                Wait 0.20 seconds
                Trigger - Turn on (This trigger)
            Else - Actions
        Set VariableSet Chance_StolenGoods = 0
        Wait 5.00 seconds
        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
        Destructible - Remove KoboldChestDying
        Wait 0.20 seconds
        Trigger - Turn on (This trigger)
        Trigger - Remove (This trigger) from the trigger queue
